    {"t": "David’s song of deliverance", "c": [["2SA", "22:1-51"], ["PSA", "18:1-50"]], "n": "Psalm 18 in the Hebrew and English numbering (Psalm 17 in the Greek and Latin). Verse numbers can differ by one where the title is counted."},
    {"t": "David’s census", "c": [["2SA", "24:1-25"], ["1CH", "21:1-30"]], "n": "Samuel says the LORD incited David; Chronicles says Satan did."},
